<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/dutch-empire"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Dutch%20Empire.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Dutch Empire</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Suriname's independence ends the Dutch colonial empire</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/suriname"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Suriname.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Suriname</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Suriname becomes independent on 25 November</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/new-zealand"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/New%20Zealand.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>New Zealand</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Treaty of Waitangi Act creates the Waitangi Tribunal</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-finland"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20Finland.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of Finland</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Helsinki Final Act is signed at the Conference on Security and Co-operation in Europe</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/indonesia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Indonesia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Indonesia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Indonesian forces invade East Timor</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-india"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20India.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of India</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Indira Gandhi declares the Emergency, suspending civil liberties until 1977</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/tanzania"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Tanzania.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Tanzania</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Tanzania–Zambia Railway is completed</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/language/quechua"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Quechua.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Quechua</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Peru makes Quechua an official language</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/government/colonial-rule"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Colonial%20rule.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Colonial rule</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Angola and Mozambique win independence after Portugal’s Carnation Revolution</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/hellenic-republic"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Hellenic%20Republic.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Hellenic Republic</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A democratic and republican constitution is promulgated after a referendum chooses not to restore the monarchy.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/lebanese-republic"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Lebanese%20Republic.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Lebanese Republic</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Full-scale civil war breaks out between Christian groups and the forces of the PLO and left-wing Druze and Muslim militias.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/kingdom-of-morocco"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kingdom%20of%20Morocco.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kingdom of Morocco</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">On 6 November some 350,000 civilians cross into the Spanish Sahara in the Green March; Spain cedes the territory to Morocco and Mauritania and Moroccan forces occupy it.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/east-timor"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/East%20Timor.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>East Timor</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">On 28 November Fretilin unilaterally declares independence; nine days later, on 7 December, the Indonesian military invades East Timor.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/rhodesia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Rhodesia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Rhodesia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The end of Portuguese rule in Mozambique after the Carnation Revolution leaves Rhodesia almost surrounded by hostile states.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/derg"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Derg.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Derg</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">On 4 March the land reform 'Land to the Tiller' nationalises all rural land and abolishes tenancy; the monarchy is formally abolished the same month, and Haile Selassie dies on 27 August.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/culture/inuit"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Inuit.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Inuit</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The James Bay and Northern Quebec Agreement settles the land claim of the Quebec Inuit, with autonomy in the new region of Nunavik</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/parthenon"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Parthenon.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Parthenon</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Greek government sets up the Committee for the Conservation of the Acropolis Monuments to preserve and restore the buildings</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/borobudur"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Borobudur.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Borobudur</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Indonesia and UNESCO begin the restoration that takes down and resets over one million stones</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/democratic-republic-of-vietnam"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Democratic%20Republic%20of%20Vietnam.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Democratic Republic of Vietnam</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Saigon falls on 30 April, and South Vietnam comes under the Provisional Revolutionary Government</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/francoist-spain"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Francoist%20Spain.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Francoist Spain</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Franco dies on 20 November, and Juan Carlos becomes King of Spain</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/portuguese-angola"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Portuguese%20Angola.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Portuguese Angola</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">On 11 November Angola becomes a sovereign state under the Alvor Agreement, as the People's Republic of Angola</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-vietnam"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20Vietnam.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of Vietnam</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Communist forces overrun Saigon, and President Dương Văn Minh surrenders South Vietnam unconditionally on 30 April</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/histories-of-herodotus"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Histories%20of%20Herodotus.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Histories of Herodotus</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Gelonus, the Scythian city Herodotus described, is rediscovered</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/bagan"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Bagan.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Bagan</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A major earthquake on 8 July damaged many temples, some of them irreparably</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/american-indian-movement"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/American%20Indian%20Movement.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>American Indian Movement</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Two FBI agents, Jack Coler and Ronald Williams, are killed on the Pine Ridge Reservation</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/religion/rastafari"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Rastafari.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Rastafari</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Haile Selassie dies a year after his overthrow by the Derg, which causes a crisis of faith for many practitioners</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/religion/jehovahs-witnesses"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Jehovah's%20Witnesses.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Jehovah's Witnesses</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">After publications built expectation that Christ's thousand-year reign might begin, a failed prediction is followed by a decline in membership</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/religion/caodaism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Caodaism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Caodaism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">After the fall of Saigon the incoming communist government bans the practice of Caodaism</span></li></ul></section>
